---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for AV Guides."
>
  <article class="prose legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: August 2, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      AV Guides (“we”, “this site”) is a static informational website. This policy
      describes what data may be collected when you visit.
    </p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server / CDN logs</strong> — hosting providers (e.g. Vercel, Cloudflare)
        may log IP address, user agent, and request URLs for security and reliability.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics</strong> — if we enable privacy-friendly analytics later, we
        will name the provider here.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Advertising</strong> — if we enable Google AdSense or similar networks,
        those partners may use cookies or device identifiers to serve and measure ads.
        See their policies for details.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The core site does not require cookies. Third-party ads or analytics may set cookies
      when enabled. You can control cookies in your browser settings.
    </p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      The site discusses a Roblox game and may be visited by younger players. We do not
      knowingly collect personal information from children. Roblox and in-game activity
      are governed by Roblox’s own policies.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: see our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
